WEBVTT

00:24.850 --> 00:27.790
Kifumura Entrance

00:37.470 --> 00:39.399
Kifumura Entrance.

00:39.400 --> 00:41.739
Last stop, Kifumura Entrance.

00:41.740 --> 00:42.900
I'm getting off!

00:43.370 --> 00:44.670
I'm getting off!

00:44.010 --> 00:45.940
- Kifumura Entrance
- Last stop

00:44.671 --> 00:45.940
East-West Bus Route

01:05.860 --> 01:07.190
How nostalgic.

01:07.760 --> 01:10.290
I remember this area.

01:19.940 --> 01:23.170
That's right. I'm early.

01:30.920 --> 01:31.920
Out of Range

01:33.090 --> 01:35.280
No way. No service?

01:46.330 --> 01:49.740
I think this is the way
to my grandma's house.

01:52.240 --> 01:54.270
All right! I guess I'll go see.

02:00.650 --> 02:04.590
Hiiro no Kakera

02:05.120 --> 02:07.120
The Tamayori

02:07.121 --> 02:08.470
Princess

02:08.471 --> 02:10.350
My luggage is so heavy!

02:14.360 --> 02:16.230
Just my imagination?

02:19.570 --> 02:20.570
Ow!

02:35.050 --> 02:36.710
What is that?

02:37.990 --> 02:39.150
Is it alive?

02:43.260 --> 02:44.260
What's this?

02:44.560 --> 02:45.789
An offering?

02:45.790 --> 02:47.320
It talks?

02:49.430 --> 02:51.300
Wait a second!

02:59.540 --> 03:01.770
Wh-What is that?

03:08.920 --> 03:10.440
Don't go that way!

03:15.920 --> 03:17.090
Stop moving.

03:17.560 --> 03:20.159
If you panic, the gods will become uneasy.

03:20.160 --> 03:21.360
Gods?

03:24.600 --> 03:26.760
Take this and use it.

03:27.400 --> 03:29.840
Do you want to be taken
to the ends of this world?

03:31.970 --> 03:33.970
Then repeat after me.

03:34.340 --> 03:35.939
The sky, my father,

03:35.940 --> 03:37.850
the earth, my mother.

03:38.750 --> 03:39.849
Hurry up!

03:39.850 --> 03:41.940
I'm not good at incantations.

03:42.250 --> 03:43.819
The sky, my father,

03:43.820 --> 03:45.619
the earth, my mother.

03:45.620 --> 03:47.110
O-Okay.

03:47.690 --> 03:51.929
Th-The sky, my father,

03:51.930 --> 03:54.329
the earth, my mother...

03:54.330 --> 03:56.029
Within this country...

03:56.030 --> 03:57.500
Within this country...

03:57.870 --> 03:59.299
Sagittarius, The Dipper,

03:59.300 --> 04:00.770
Three Pedestals, Jeweled Girl.

04:01.000 --> 04:02.769
Sagittarius, The Dipper,

04:02.770 --> 04:04.570
Three Pedestals, Jeweled Girl.

04:04.910 --> 04:07.079
Left Blue Dragon, Right White Tiger,

04:07.080 --> 04:09.570
Front Vermilion Bird,
Back Black Tortoise, help me.

04:09.740 --> 04:11.909
Left Blue Dragon, Right White Tiger,

04:11.910 --> 04:15.350
Front Vermilion Bird,
Back Black Tortoise, help me.

04:17.420 --> 04:19.319
Stay calm. It's all right.

04:19.320 --> 04:20.520
I'm right here.

04:22.460 --> 04:24.059
Hold it and speak:

04:24.060 --> 04:25.229
Hurry, Tathata's Command!

04:25.230 --> 04:26.690
Hurry, Tathata's Command!

04:37.270 --> 04:38.970
Now's our chance. Let's go!

05:07.340 --> 05:10.330
U-Um... Thank you for before.

05:11.110 --> 05:13.440
I'm Tamaki Kasuga.

05:13.910 --> 05:15.009
Thought so.

05:15.010 --> 05:16.140
What?

05:17.480 --> 05:18.950
I'm Takuma Onizaki.

05:19.380 --> 05:22.449
By Lady Baba's decree,
I've come to meet you.

05:22.450 --> 05:23.519
By Lady Baba...

05:23.520 --> 05:24.880
Grandma?

05:26.950 --> 05:28.420
Hey, wait.

05:29.590 --> 05:31.129
That just now...

05:31.130 --> 05:32.130
Spiriting away.

05:32.830 --> 05:34.090
Spiriting away?

05:36.500 --> 05:39.020
You don't know anything, do you?

05:40.640 --> 05:43.070
I'm not good at these
kinds of explanations.

05:43.670 --> 05:46.470
When you get there, ask Lady Baba yourself!

05:49.880 --> 05:51.349
This way.

05:51.350 --> 05:53.210
Th-This way?!

05:53.680 --> 05:55.550
F-Fine then!

06:07.400 --> 06:07.860
Thank yo-

06:07.861 --> 06:09.850
You sure are clumsy.

06:11.670 --> 06:14.300
C-Clumsy!

06:14.970 --> 06:16.839
I thought he was a nice person,

06:16.840 --> 06:18.030
but he's the worst!

06:21.240 --> 06:22.579
Well then,

06:22.580 --> 06:24.980
give Ugaya my sincerest regards.

06:32.250 --> 06:33.720
You're the granddaughter?

06:34.060 --> 06:35.990
We've called you at such a tough time.

06:40.560 --> 06:43.000
Well, I hope you'll forgive us.

06:45.270 --> 06:47.740
Did that man have some
business with Lady Baba?

06:48.370 --> 06:50.570
Yes, it seemed so.

06:50.810 --> 06:52.710
Welcome back, Onizaki.

06:53.810 --> 06:55.400
Is that her?

06:55.740 --> 06:56.900
Yes.

06:57.210 --> 06:58.940
You've arrived early.

06:59.710 --> 07:02.740
I'm descended from a
branch of the Ugaya house.

07:03.280 --> 07:05.280
My name is Mitsuru Kotokura.

07:07.590 --> 07:08.919
It's a pleasure to meet you!

07:08.920 --> 07:10.090
I'm-

07:09.160 --> 07:11.060
Everyone already knows you.

07:13.660 --> 07:16.130
Lady Baba is waiting for you in her room.

07:17.630 --> 07:18.900
This way please.

07:20.100 --> 07:21.260
Okay.

07:23.270 --> 07:25.500
Lady Baba, I've brought her.

07:27.440 --> 07:28.679
Grandma!

07:28.680 --> 07:30.909
Welcome, Tamaki.

07:30.910 --> 07:33.400
Were Misuzu and Kenji well?

07:34.180 --> 07:36.150
Y-Yeah...

07:36.950 --> 07:39.720
I heard they were suddenly
transferred to Africa for work.

07:39.950 --> 07:41.959
Mother complained,

07:41.960 --> 07:45.429
but Father said they were
building a school for children

07:45.430 --> 07:47.089
and he was all for it.

07:47.090 --> 07:48.459
Is that so?

07:48.460 --> 07:50.259
But, Grandma,

07:50.260 --> 07:52.529
I saw something strange earlier.

07:52.530 --> 07:53.630
I know.

07:54.840 --> 07:57.169
The reason the gods were agitated

07:57.170 --> 07:59.539
was because you had made it this far.

07:59.540 --> 08:00.940
But you know, Tamaki,

08:01.740 --> 08:05.270
I believe you were able to
see them long before now.

08:06.450 --> 08:07.970
See them?

08:08.850 --> 08:09.850
Yes.

08:10.790 --> 08:13.449
The reason you were
able to see that small god,

08:13.450 --> 08:17.059
and those drowned gods, is
because coursing through you

08:17.060 --> 08:20.359
is the blood of Princess Tamayori.

08:20.360 --> 08:22.990
The blood of Princess Tamayori?

08:23.730 --> 08:27.600
Have you heard of the eight million gods?

08:28.000 --> 08:29.100
No.

08:29.670 --> 08:33.160
Gods are not simply divine beings.

08:33.840 --> 08:37.300
The drowned gods who
attacked you were gods, as well.

08:38.210 --> 08:42.310
When a god is no longer
worshiped, a ghost is born.

08:42.880 --> 08:46.320
Gods and ghosts are
two sides of the same coin.

08:47.050 --> 08:48.320
Listen well, Tamaki.

08:48.990 --> 08:51.860
A barrier surrounds this village,

08:52.130 --> 08:56.030
and the thing that is sealed
inside is the Onikirimaru.

08:57.230 --> 08:58.700
Onikirimaru?

09:00.840 --> 09:03.299
A god's first resolution,

09:03.300 --> 09:05.300
the power to destroy the world.

09:06.210 --> 09:08.639
Since long ago, we,

09:08.640 --> 09:11.610
the Tamayori princesses,
have kept it sealed away.

09:12.450 --> 09:15.219
Since that seal has weakened,

09:15.220 --> 09:17.380
the gods have become agitated.

09:18.450 --> 09:22.119
This is because my role as the

09:22.120 --> 09:24.990
Tamayori princess is coming to a close.

09:26.490 --> 09:28.199
So, Tamaki,

09:28.200 --> 09:32.569
you must once again seal the Onikirimaru,

09:32.570 --> 09:35.300
as one who carries the
blood of Tamayori must.

09:36.100 --> 09:39.100
This is why I have called you here.

09:39.610 --> 09:41.079
Called?

09:41.080 --> 09:44.109
Grandma, I came because
Father was transferred to-

09:44.110 --> 09:45.370
Don't worry.

09:45.780 --> 09:49.410
Eventually, your Tamayori
blood will reveal your path.

09:55.090 --> 09:56.920
Hi... Mother?

09:55.890 --> 09:56.919
Oh, Tamaki!

09:56.920 --> 09:58.289
How is everything over there?

09:58.290 --> 10:00.259
It's so hot over here!

10:00.260 --> 10:02.299
More importantly, Mother,

10:02.300 --> 10:04.099
did you know about the
Tamayori princesses?

10:04.100 --> 10:06.900
Grandma told me she
wants me to succeed her.

10:07.100 --> 10:10.469
Oh, like a shrine maiden
of the temple, right?

10:10.470 --> 10:11.470
It's fine, isn't it?

10:12.140 --> 10:13.809
Once upon a time,

10:13.810 --> 10:17.109
your mother watered and
mopped and all kinds of things.

10:17.110 --> 10:20.450
But make sure you do
your school work as well!

10:21.050 --> 10:23.179
Well, I'm heading out in a
bit, so I'll talk to you later.

10:23.180 --> 10:24.520
Say hi to Grandma for me!

10:29.160 --> 10:31.220
Is that really what this is?

10:36.800 --> 10:38.060
You're...

10:39.400 --> 10:42.370
A species of ghost known as an Osaki fox.

10:43.300 --> 10:46.800
They have protected the heads
of this household for generations.

10:47.640 --> 10:48.839
Ghost?

10:48.840 --> 10:50.239
Yes.

10:50.240 --> 10:53.279
Most people cannot see them,

10:53.280 --> 10:56.149
but they will stay by the
side of a Tamayori princess,

10:56.150 --> 10:57.810
such as yourself, and protect you.

10:58.290 --> 10:59.510
Tamayori princess...

11:01.820 --> 11:04.550
It is true that I can see her.

11:06.330 --> 11:07.730
She's so cute.

11:18.470 --> 11:19.960
So you can do that, too!

11:21.680 --> 11:24.670
Well then, I will show you to your room.

11:25.880 --> 11:26.880
Thank you.

11:28.350 --> 11:30.889
<i>What Grandma said still bothers me,</i>

11:30.890 --> 11:33.010
<i>but I'm tired after everything
that's happened today.</i>

11:33.490 --> 11:34.490
<i>I should rest for now.</i>

11:35.190 --> 11:36.250
This way.

11:38.860 --> 11:40.730
Wh-Why is this guy here?

11:41.560 --> 11:44.120
And he's using my bag as a pillow.

11:45.530 --> 11:46.899
I'm sorry.

11:46.900 --> 11:50.030
I told him to carry it to my room, but...

11:50.710 --> 11:52.839
He must be tired after using incantations

11:52.840 --> 11:54.370
he's not accustomed to.

11:55.210 --> 11:58.370
<i>I guess he did save me...</i>

11:58.980 --> 12:00.540
You sure are clumsy.

12:01.280 --> 12:02.980
I don't want anything to do with him.

12:03.520 --> 12:05.150
He's so insensitive.

12:05.720 --> 12:06.955
Tamaki Kasuga

12:06.956 --> 12:10.060
She just transferred into our class today.

12:08.560 --> 12:10.059
<i>We're even in the same class!</i>

12:10.060 --> 12:11.530
Please welcome Tamaki Kasuga.

12:11.690 --> 12:12.850
Her father...

12:17.770 --> 12:18.899
I'm starving.

12:18.900 --> 12:19.929
Let's get lunch.

12:19.930 --> 12:21.230
Wanna go get some bread?

12:23.000 --> 12:24.369
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

12:24.370 --> 12:27.340
<i>I ended up coming to school
without seeing Grandma again.</i>

12:27.840 --> 12:29.279
<i>I have to ask her about
the Tamayori princess—</i>

12:29.280 --> 12:30.339
Hey, hey, hey!

12:30.340 --> 12:32.370
You were checking me out, weren't you?

12:32.880 --> 12:34.680
Thought so.

12:35.250 --> 12:36.749
We might be fated to be together

12:36.750 --> 12:38.889
<i>Amazing!</i>
since we're both transfer students.

12:38.890 --> 12:40.790
I say transfer student,

12:38.890 --> 12:40.789
<i>She really can't see the Osaki fox.</i>

12:40.790 --> 12:42.780
But I've actually been here for a while.

12:43.320 --> 12:45.380
I'm Kiyono Takara.

12:45.590 --> 12:46.720
Nice to meet you.

12:47.090 --> 12:48.090
Kasuga...

12:48.430 --> 12:49.910
Would you mind if
I called you Tamaki?

12:50.160 --> 12:51.560
You're from Tokyo, right?

12:51.970 --> 12:53.090
Yeah.

12:53.400 --> 12:54.899
How awesome! Tokyo!

12:54.900 --> 12:57.370
If you have any questions,
don't hesitate to ask!

12:58.610 --> 13:00.039
Thanks!

13:00.040 --> 13:01.530
Then, I do have a question.

13:01.740 --> 13:03.709
Does everyone in Kifumura
know about the Tamayori-

13:03.710 --> 13:04.740
Come with me!

13:07.950 --> 13:09.180
Wait, what?

13:09.320 --> 13:10.519
What are you doing?

13:10.520 --> 13:11.540
Just come!

13:13.450 --> 13:15.420
Hey! Let go of me!

13:16.090 --> 13:17.090
Jeez...

13:17.630 --> 13:19.820
I could've been friends with them!

13:20.360 --> 13:22.890
Do you understand your position here?

13:23.730 --> 13:25.669
There are tons of people who'd love

13:25.670 --> 13:27.469
to get their hands on the
power of a Tamayori princess.

13:27.470 --> 13:29.539
Don't you get that?

13:29.540 --> 13:31.009
Lecture me all you like,

13:31.010 --> 13:33.409
but suddenly being told that
I'm a Tamayori princess

13:33.410 --> 13:34.740
doesn't make any sense to me!

13:36.810 --> 13:39.180
So she's the princess.

13:40.180 --> 13:41.770
Doesn't look like it.

13:44.290 --> 13:45.689
That's true.

13:45.690 --> 13:48.880
Shouldn't you be showing some
respect to those superior to you?

13:49.290 --> 13:51.660
Yes. She is a princess.

14:00.670 --> 14:02.800
<i>A—Amazing!</i>

14:04.070 --> 14:09.100
W-Wait, shouldn't elementary
school boys be at elementary school?

14:10.740 --> 14:12.010
Takuma!

14:12.380 --> 14:14.140
Brace yourself!

14:16.620 --> 14:17.520
What?

14:17.521 --> 14:19.019
I didn't say anything, did I?

14:19.020 --> 14:21.019
As if I care!

14:21.020 --> 14:22.689
I don't punch girls!

14:22.690 --> 14:23.795
Show some respect!

14:23.796 --> 14:25.150
Hey, you! Cut it out.

14:25.530 --> 14:28.550
You?! I'm Mahiro Atori!

14:28.960 --> 14:31.130
Mahiro Atori-kun, right?

14:31.900 --> 14:33.999
It should be senpai. Mahiro-senpai.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.940
Just call him senpai.

14:36.240 --> 14:38.540
He's one year older than us.

14:41.880 --> 14:43.509
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

14:43.510 --> 14:45.049
I'm Tamaki Kasuga!

14:45.050 --> 14:46.270
It's a pleasure to meet you!

14:47.750 --> 14:51.810
By Lady Baba's decree,
we'll be protecting you.

14:52.350 --> 14:53.820
P-Protecting me?

14:53.990 --> 14:55.480
Didn't they tell you?

14:56.160 --> 14:58.250
We're part of the Shugogo family.

14:58.430 --> 15:02.490
You carry the blood of the Tamayori
princess, whom the Shugogo protect.

15:03.330 --> 15:05.890
So we have to protect you.

15:06.370 --> 15:08.100
That's how it's always been.

15:09.540 --> 15:11.530
<i>Tamayori, again...</i>

15:15.780 --> 15:17.309
We'll continue this after school.

15:17.310 --> 15:18.310
Come to the library.

15:18.910 --> 15:20.130
Library

15:20.131 --> 15:23.870
So, I went like they told me to, but...

15:26.850 --> 15:29.020
Mahiro?

15:30.420 --> 15:31.829
Huh...

15:31.830 --> 15:33.290
Are you here?

16:01.760 --> 16:02.950
Good girl.

16:03.690 --> 16:05.459
You can see her?

16:05.460 --> 16:07.720
The Osaki fox is similar to our master.

16:09.800 --> 16:12.670
Whether you are strong or
weak depends on yourself.

16:13.970 --> 16:15.739
I hope you grow up to be a good girl.

16:15.740 --> 16:16.839
What's this?

16:16.840 --> 16:18.139
So, you've already met.

16:18.140 --> 16:19.609
Hey, Senpai.

16:19.610 --> 16:21.370
He's also part of the Shugogo family.

16:22.780 --> 16:24.180
Yuichi Komura.

16:24.550 --> 16:26.049
N-Nice to meet you!

16:26.050 --> 16:27.349
I'm Tamaki Kasuga.

16:27.350 --> 16:28.540
It's a pleasure!

16:31.490 --> 16:32.620
He's asleep, isn't he?

16:32.621 --> 16:33.650
Yep. Sound asleep.

16:34.690 --> 16:35.820
He's asleep?

16:37.360 --> 16:39.859
This guy's special talent is
his ability to fall asleep instantly,

16:39.860 --> 16:41.929
anytime and anywhere.

16:41.930 --> 16:43.400
R-Right...

16:45.500 --> 16:48.200
They all seem like a bunch of weirdos.

16:49.100 --> 16:50.660
What'd you say?!

16:51.640 --> 16:53.669
Takuma!

16:53.670 --> 16:55.300
Brace yourself!

16:55.540 --> 16:56.600
Again?

16:57.410 --> 16:59.850
Mahiro, are you getting enough calcium?

17:00.510 --> 17:02.049
If you don't drink milk, you'll never gro-

17:02.050 --> 17:04.810
You want one of these, too, Yuichi?

17:07.820 --> 17:09.410
You all seem to get along.

17:09.890 --> 17:11.059
I guess.

17:11.060 --> 17:12.750
We're partners, after all.

17:13.330 --> 17:14.390
Partners?

17:16.000 --> 17:17.659
We're partners in our fate

17:17.660 --> 17:20.430
as Shugogo members to
protect the Tamayori princess.

17:21.100 --> 17:22.339
Fate?

17:22.340 --> 17:26.240
We're here protecting you
on your way home, aren't we?

17:27.340 --> 17:31.249
And just when I think the all
important Tamayori princess arrived,

17:31.250 --> 17:32.800
it turns out she's kind of unreliable.

17:33.750 --> 17:35.610
I don't understand.

17:37.020 --> 17:40.349
I only met you all today or yesterday,

17:40.350 --> 17:42.219
and even though you don't know me,

17:42.220 --> 17:44.560
you're told to protect me because
I'm a Tamayori princess.

17:44.990 --> 17:46.760
You're even walking me home.

17:48.900 --> 17:51.230
Don't you think it's a
little much to accept?

17:52.070 --> 17:53.190
I do think so.

17:54.400 --> 17:59.070
I'm sure my father and
grandfather thought the same thing.

17:59.840 --> 18:02.570
Everyone in your family
was probably the same, too.

18:03.010 --> 18:04.210
Then, why?

18:05.680 --> 18:07.840
We're bound by blood.

18:08.520 --> 18:10.350
No one can deny it.

18:10.550 --> 18:11.640
That's...

18:12.420 --> 18:14.390
That's not right.

18:24.400 --> 18:25.730
Welcome home.

18:26.230 --> 18:28.670
Today we're celebrating
Lady Tamaki's arrival.

18:29.100 --> 18:31.409
Dinner has been prepared in the other room.

18:31.410 --> 18:32.410
All right!

18:32.411 --> 18:33.430
Good evening.

18:34.310 --> 18:35.830
Nice to meet you, Tamaki.

18:36.580 --> 18:38.109
I'm a part of the Shugogo family,

18:38.110 --> 18:39.140
Suguru Ohmi.

18:39.750 --> 18:40.779
Nice to meet you.

18:40.780 --> 18:41.870
I'm Tamaki Kasuga.

18:42.450 --> 18:45.890
I'll be acting, temporarily,
as mediator for the five.

18:46.450 --> 18:47.920
I look forward to it.

18:48.590 --> 18:49.820
Uh... Right!

18:50.290 --> 18:52.489
<i>Thank goodness there's
someone who seems normal.</i>

18:52.490 --> 18:54.659
What are you getting all starry-eyed for?

18:54.660 --> 18:55.729
No, this is-

18:55.730 --> 18:58.160
Who cares?! Let's eat!

18:58.800 --> 19:00.730
If we don't eat soon, it'll get cold.

19:01.970 --> 19:03.060
You, too!

19:04.940 --> 19:05.940
Okay!

19:07.170 --> 19:10.840
The key to hot pots is to put
the slow cooking radish in first.

19:11.040 --> 19:12.440
Right, Takuma?

19:12.680 --> 19:13.810
Yes, magistrate!

19:15.020 --> 19:16.280
Is there meat inside?

19:17.050 --> 19:18.640
Of course there is.

19:18.920 --> 19:21.410
A hot pot without meat would be blasphemy!

19:22.720 --> 19:24.060
Is Grandma coming?

19:24.860 --> 19:27.450
She will be spending the
evening quietly in her room.

19:27.860 --> 19:28.800
I see...

19:28.801 --> 19:30.020
It's ready!

19:39.540 --> 19:41.200
I'm so full!

19:41.880 --> 19:43.870
<i>We're bound by blood.</i>

19:47.880 --> 19:50.679
They all seem like bright
and cheerful people,

19:50.680 --> 19:51.880
so why...?

19:52.220 --> 19:53.310
You'll catch a cold.

19:54.520 --> 19:57.150
Fall is halfway over.

20:02.360 --> 20:03.960
R-Right...

20:05.830 --> 20:07.030
Are you all right?

20:08.370 --> 20:10.860
You seem bewildered with everything.

20:12.810 --> 20:16.170
What is the Shugogo house?

20:17.580 --> 20:20.579
Everyone says that it's their fate,

20:20.580 --> 20:23.480
but I can't accept that.

20:24.050 --> 20:25.689
You've heard that

20:25.690 --> 20:29.319
the blood of the Tamayori
is the most important element

20:29.320 --> 20:31.550
in protecting the Onikirimaru?

20:33.830 --> 20:38.200
Protecting the Tamayori princess
is our, the Shugogo's, duty.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.199
We're called the five,

20:41.200 --> 20:43.030
even though there are only four of us.

20:44.570 --> 20:49.079
All of us have some strange
blood running through us,

20:49.080 --> 20:52.570
so we're not technically human.

20:54.620 --> 20:57.210
It's not about whether
you accept it or not.

20:57.580 --> 21:00.350
We simply exist for that purpose.

21:02.290 --> 21:04.920
There's no need to take
everything on at once.

21:05.860 --> 21:11.890
We've all had time to
come to terms with our fate.

21:15.240 --> 21:16.439
Ohmi.

21:16.440 --> 21:17.630
What are you doing?

21:17.770 --> 21:19.309
You, too, Leading Lady.

21:19.310 --> 21:20.570
The rice gruel is ready.

21:21.070 --> 21:22.440
Onions, onions.

21:22.810 --> 21:24.009
Shall we go inside?

21:24.010 --> 21:25.100
Yes!

21:25.610 --> 21:28.319
I was hoping to use the
hot pot broth for udon,

21:28.320 --> 21:29.760
but a rice gruel could be nice, too.

21:32.250 --> 21:35.650
<i>No need to take everything on at once...</i>

21:38.290 --> 21:39.459
<i>Yes, It'll be okay.</i>

21:39.460 --> 21:41.930
<i>The sun will be shining tomorrow.</i>

21:44.600 --> 21:49.899
Ne kimi wa ima dare wo omotteiruno?
Hey who are you thinking of now?

21:49.900 --> 21:57.810
Watashi wa kimi wo omotteiruyo
I am thinking of you

22:00.450 --> 22:03.119
Mado wo akeruto kanjita
I felt it when I opened my window

22:03.120 --> 22:05.349
Ah yoru no nioi
Ah the smell of the night

22:05.350 --> 22:07.949
Ima dare no kao ga
Whose face did I just see

22:07.950 --> 22:10.219
Kokoro no naka ni ukanda?
In my heart?

22:10.220 --> 22:12.989
Tsumetai ame zubunureni
When I was

22:12.990 --> 22:15.229
Natteta watashi ni
Soaked by the cold rain

22:15.230 --> 22:16.899
Kimidake ga sono te wo
You were the only one

22:16.900 --> 22:19.869
Sashinobete kuretanda
To reach out your hand

22:19.870 --> 22:24.709
Naze itsumo kimi nandaro
Why are you always

22:24.710 --> 22:29.339
Sasaete kureru hito wa
The one to support me

22:29.340 --> 22:32.249
Sono tabi Each time

22:32.250 --> 22:36.549
Mata suki ni natteiku
I fall deeper in love

22:36.550 --> 22:41.789
Ne nani shitemo kimi ni aitaku naruyo
Hey no matter what I do I want to see you

22:41.790 --> 22:46.489
Suki ni narutte kurushiindane
Falling in love hurts

22:46.490 --> 22:51.769
Ureshiku naru no mo setsunaku saserunomo
You are always the only reason

22:51.770 --> 22:59.670
Itsudemo riyu wa kimi dake dayo
I feel happiness and heartache

23:02.640 --> 23:10.640
Ima kimi wo omotteruyo
I am thinking of you

23:23.330 --> 23:25.320
We've been waiting for you,

23:28.340 --> 23:29.860
Monado.

23:36.610 --> 23:38.410
I'm glad I saw you today.

23:39.610 --> 23:41.710
Let us meet again next time.

23:49.390 --> 23:51.860
I will... always be

23:52.890 --> 23:54.590
waiting here for your arrival.

23:55.200 --> 24:00.900
Next time: Determined First Step
